"decorators, :meth:`~microdot.Microdot.mount`, :func:`microdot.abort`, "
":func:`microdot.redirect`, :meth:`~microdot.Microdot.start_server`, "
":meth:`~microdot.Microdot.run`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`/library/microdot` —— :class:`microdot.Microdot`\\ 、\\ "
":class:`~microdot.Request`\\ 、\\ :class:`~microdot.Response`\\ 、各個路由裝飾器、\\ "
":meth:`~microdot.Microdot.mount`\\ 、\\ :func:`microdot.abort`\\ 、\\ "
":func:`microdot.redirect`\\ 、\\ :meth:`~microdot.Microdot.start_server`\\ "
